        <body>
            <div xml:id="d641-a4">

                <pb facs="0906" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg800"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.—Cablegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt
                        to the American Embassy, London.</hi></head>
                <p>You are at liberty to inform the Grocers’ Federation that under the new law we
                    can, and will, guarantee the fitness in all respects of canned meat bearing the
                    government stamp. If any trouble arises therewith, protest can be made, not
                    merely to sellers of goods, but to the United States Government itself.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
